 is a good guy (as per point 5), and he fights his nemesis (point 4), it follows that the nemesis must also be a good guy.\n- According to point 7, if Sir Digby wins the fight, his nemesis also wins.\n\nTherefore, based on the provided context, the statement "Sir Digby’s nemesis wins" is true.\n\n<answer>\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
