 travel to Paris for his honeymoon. Therefore, the statement "John has at least one child" would be true because it aligns with the condition that if John has at least one child, he can have a wedding and travel to Paris for his honeymoon. Thus, the correct answer is:.\nD\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
