r, being a type of bile duct cancer, is also a deadly disease.\n\nThe statement "Colorectal cancer is not a severe cancer" is true because it contradicts the information that colorectal cancer is a bile duct cancer, which is a severe cancer.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
