ed from Italian. The fact that Neapolitan Chronicles was translated from Italian solidifies this evidence and confirms the origin of Palace of Flies.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is:.\nA) True.\n</think>.\n<answer>\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
