ans he cannot travel to Paris for his honeymoon either.\n\n6.**If John has a wedding that is well-attended, then John has a wedding in July or, if not, then John travels to Paris for their honeymoon.**.This rule states that if John has a poorly-attended wedding, he must neither have a wedding in July nor travel to Paris for his honeymoon.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
