n asks if the statement "Yuri is an American" is true, false, or uncertain. Based on the analysis, we can definitively say that Yuri is an American because the information explicitly states that he is not an American. It is certain that he is an American. Thus, the correct answer is true.\n\n<answer>\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
