formation**:.\n   - We need to find out if Bonnie performs in school talent shows often.\n   - The key piece of information here is that Bonnie either attends and is very engaged with school events or is neither engaged nor attends the school.\n\n3.**Logical Reasoning**:.Bonnie performs in school talent shows often.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
